      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَآءَهُ مُنْكِدًا</span></b>  <i>He came to him unwelcomely:</i> or,
<i>empty:</i> or, as Th says, it is correctly <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْكِزًا</span>, from
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَكَرَتِ البِئْرُ</span>, though <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنْكَزَ</span> as meaning “ his wells
became exhausted, ” has not been heard. (L.)

